# Said in the password box when only Debian's updates are put in.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
common-updating-reason-debian = Les mises à jour de Debian modifient tout l'ordinateur, pour tous ceux qui l'utilisent, elles demandent donc le mot de passe d'un administrateur.

# Said in the password box when only Trindle's own update is put in.
